ependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"https://getpsalm.org/r/fa83e8b8fc\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\n/** \r\n * @template TKey\r\n * @template TValue\r\n */\r\nclass Collection {\r\n    /**\r\n     * @param Closure(TValue):bool $p\r\n     * @return Collection<TKey,TValue>\r\n     */\r\n    public function filter(Closure $p);\r\n}\r\nclass I {}\r\n\r\n/** @var Collection<mixed,Collection<mixed,I>> $c */\r\n$c = new Collection;\r\n\r\n$c->filter(\r\n  /** @param Collection<mixed,I> $elt */\r\n  function(Collection $elt): bool { return (bool) rand(0,1); }\r\n);\r\n\r\n$c->filter(\r\n  /** @param Collection<mixed,I> $elt */\r\n  function(Collection $elt): bool { return true; }\r\n);\r\n```\r\n**Expected**: no issues\r\n**Actual**: the first call to `filter()` complains that it needs `Closure(Collection<mixed,I>):bool` but it got `Closure(Collection<mixed,I>):bool` instead (I don't see any difference in those types though). The second one doesn't like closure returning `true` where it expects closure returning `bool`.","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":fal